# Pancake Design System Rules

## Overview
This document defines the design system and component patterns for the Pancake Facebook inbox management application. It serves as the canonical reference for Figma-to-code integration using Model Context Protocol.

---

## 1. Token Definitions

### Color System
- **Primary**: `blue-600` (#2563eb) for primary actions, CTAs, and interactive elements
- **Primary Hover**: `blue-700` (#1d4ed8)
- **Background**: `white` (#ffffff) for main content areas
- **Surface**: `gray-50` (#f9fafb) for secondary backgrounds
- **Border**: `gray-200` (#e5e7eb) for dividers and outlines
- **Text Primary**: `gray-900` (#111827) for headings and important text
- **Text Secondary**: `gray-600` (#4b5563) for body text
- **Text Tertiary**: `gray-500` (#6b7280) for supporting text
- **Error**: `red-600` (#dc2626)
- **Success**: `green-600` (#16a34a)

### Typography
- **Font Family**: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif (system fonts)
- **Heading 1**: `text-4xl font-bold` (36px)
- **Heading 2**: `text-2xl font-bold` (24px)
- **Heading 3**: `text-lg font-semibold` (18px)
- **Body**: `text-sm` or `text-base` (14-16px)
- **Caption**: `text-xs` (12px)

### Spacing Scale
- **xs**: `0.25rem` (4px)
- **sm**: `0.5rem` (8px)
- **md**: `1rem` (16px)
- **lg**: `1.5rem` (24px)
- **xl**: `2rem` (32px)
- **2xl**: `3rem` (48px)

### Border Radius
- **sm**: `rounded-md` (6px)
- **md**: `rounded-lg` (8px)
- **lg**: `rounded-xl` (12px)
- **xl**: `rounded-2xl` (16px)
- **full**: `rounded-full` (pill shape)

