## 2. Component Architecture

### Component Structure
```
components/
├── layout/          # Layout components (Navbar, Sidebar, etc.)
├── chat/            # Chat-specific components
├── ui/              # Reusable UI primitives
└── [feature]/       # Feature-specific components
```

### Component Naming Convention
- Use PascalCase for component names
- Prefix feature-specific components: `[Feature][Component].tsx`
  - Example: `ChatSidebar.tsx`, `ConversationList.tsx`

### Component Props Pattern
```typescript
interface ComponentProps {
  // Required props first
  id: string;
  title: string;

  // Optional props with defaults
  variant?: 'primary' | 'secondary' | 'ghost';
  size?: 'sm' | 'md' | 'lg';
  disabled?: boolean;

  // Event handlers
  onClick?: () => void;
  onChange?: (value: string) => void;

  // Children
  children?: React.ReactNode;
}
```

---

## 3. Frameworks & Libraries

### Core Stack
- **Framework**: Next.js 16.1.6 (App Router, Turbopack)
- **Language**: TypeScript 5
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS 4 (via PostCSS)
- **State Management**: React Hooks (useState, useEffect, useMemo)
- **Real-time**: Socket.IO 4.8.3

### Styling Methodology
- **Utility-first**: Tailwind CSS classes for all styling
- **Responsive**: Mobile-first approach with `sm:`, `md:`, `lg:` breakpoints
- **Dark Mode**: Not currently implemented (reserved for future)
- **Custom CSS**: Minimal, only in `app/globals.css` for animations

### Responsive Breakpoints
- **Mobile**: Default (< 640px)
- **Small**: `sm:` (≥ 640px)
- **Medium**: `md:` (≥ 768px)
- **Large**: `lg:` (≥ 1024px)
- **XL**: `xl:` (≥ 1280px)

---

## 4. Asset Management

### Images
- **Storage**: `/public` directory
- **Optimization**: Next.js `next/image` component
- **Format**: Prefer WebP, fallback to JPEG/PNG
- **Avatar URLs**: External URLs (e.g., i.pravatar.cc for test data)

### Image Usage Pattern
```typescript
import Image from 'next/image';

<Image
  src={avatarUrl || '/default-avatar.png'}
  alt={name}
  width={40}
  height={40}
  className="w-full h-full object-cover rounded-full"
/>
```

### CDN
- Not currently configured (images served from public folder or external URLs)

